#: properties.py:306
msgid "(Pour Box) Unite a sawtooth base plinth into the high-poly positive; the printed shells get a matching socket that hugs the plinth with a tolerance fit, so they lock onto the base and can't slip. Bottom prints open"
msgstr "（灌注盒）将锯齿状底座基座合并进高模正形；打印出的外壳获得匹配的插槽，以公差配合紧贴基座，从而锁定在底座上不会滑动。底部打印为开口"

