#: panel.py:634
#: panel.py:654
msgid "1. Core_Master + Generate = core mold"
msgstr "1. Core_Master + 生成 = 芯模"

#: panel.py:635
#: panel.py:655
msgid "2. Cast the core in FIRM silicone"
msgstr "2. 用硬质硅胶浇铸芯模"

#: panel.py:636
#: panel.py:656
msgid "3. Flip this mold, fill with SOFT"
msgstr "3. 翻转此模具，填充软质硅胶"

#: panel.py:657
msgid "4. Press the core in - it locks"
msgstr "4. 压入芯模——它会锁定"

#: panel.py:637
msgid "4. Seat the core's legs on the rim"
msgstr "4. 将芯模的支脚卡在边缘上"

#: properties.py:934
msgid "A Curve or Text object to use as the label's logo (instead of the SVG file)"
msgstr "用作标签徽标的曲线或文本物体（代替 SVG 文件）"

#: properties.py:719
msgid "A castellated row along the seam"
msgstr "沿接缝的城垛状齿排"

#: properties.py:907
msgid "A label on one shell: the silicone and cast weights, the model's name, the date - whatever you type. It sits on a small framed plaque with rounded corners on the flattest spot of the shell's outside"
msgstr "一个外壳上的标签：硅胶与浇铸件重量、模型名称、日期——你输入的任何内容。它位于外壳外侧最平坦处一块带圆角的小框牌上"

#: properties.py:238
msgid "A rectangular pan around the object's footprint — simplest and strongest"
msgstr "围绕物体投影轮廓的矩形盘——最简单也最牢固"

#: panel.py:386
msgid "Add"
msgstr "添加"

#: panel.py:368
msgid "Add a plane with +"
msgstr "用 + 添加平面"

#: properties.py:313
msgid "Add an outward bolted skirt around the flat base — clamps the mold down to a board"
msgstr "在平底周围添加向外凸出的螺栓裙边——将模具压紧在底板上"

#: properties.py:445
msgid "Add full-height clamp flanges along the parting seam(s), with bolt holes, to clamp the pieces together. They hug the model's profile from top to bottom; with 3+ radial pieces every seam gets a bolted flange pair"
msgstr "沿分型接缝添加全高夹紧法兰，带螺栓孔，用于将各部件夹紧在一起。它们从顶到底贴合模型轮廓；当径向部件为 3 个或更多时，每条接缝都会有一对螺栓法兰"

#: panel.py:557
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

#: properties.py:958
msgid "After generating, write every print as STL into the Export Folder: the mold shells, base/former parts and the positive"
msgstr "生成后，将每个打印件以 STL 写入导出文件夹：模具外壳、底座/成型件部件以及正形"

#: properties.py:809
msgid "Air Vents"
msgstr "排气孔"

#: panel.py:848
msgid "Air vents"
msgstr "排气孔"

#: panel.py:761
msgid "Alignment"
msgstr "对齐"

#: properties.py:700
msgid "Alignment Keys"
msgstr "对齐键"

#: properties.py:455
msgid "Alignment keys on the wing mating faces: a raised key on one half seats into a matching socket in the other (grown by Fit Clearance), so the bolted halves can't shear. Placed between the bolt holes and sized to the wing lip"
msgstr "翼形配合面上的对齐键：一半上凸起的键嵌入另一半对应的插槽（按配合间隙放大），使螺栓连接的两半不会错位剪切。布置在螺栓孔之间，尺寸与翼缘唇边匹配"

#: properties.py:358
msgid "Also print a suction-cup former (MF_Mold_Cup): a smooth high-poly dome on a plate with four legs that seat over the open bottom (Open Bottom, with or without the key plate, or Locking Base - the former follows the base's actual height and width), tabs hugging the outer wall. Cast with the mold inverted, fill, press the former in - the material cures around the dome, leaving a suction-cup bell in the cast's base. Pop the former out after cure"
msgstr "同时打印一个吸盘成型件（MF_Mold_Cup）：一块板上的光滑高模圆顶，带四条支脚，卡在开放的底部上（Open Bottom，带或不带键板，或 Locking Base——成型件会跟随底座的实际高度和宽度），卡舌紧贴外壁。倒置模具浇铸，填充，压入成型件——材料在圆顶周围固化，在浇铸件底部留下吸盘钟形腔。固化后取出成型件"

#: properties.py:546
msgid "Also split the shell horizontally — for XL molds: each piece prints shorter, and the horizontal seam gets a bolted flange ring all around. Size the holes for your threaded inserts with Bolt Diameter (inserts in the lower lip, screws from the top)"
msgstr "还可水平拆分外壳——适用于超大模具：每个部件打印高度更短，水平接缝处四周有一圈螺栓法兰环。用螺栓直径设置螺纹嵌件的孔径（嵌件在下唇，螺丝从顶部拧入）"

#: properties.py:928
msgid "An SVG logo for the label, centred above the text (or on its own when the text is empty). Use filled paths"
msgstr "标签的 SVG 徽标，居中于文字上方（文字为空时单独显示）。请使用填充路径"

