#: properties.py:181
msgid "Cast a thin flexible SKIN (latex, silicone - a mask, a sleeve) in a direct printed mold: a printed core - the model shrunk inward by the skin thickness - stands on the key plate inside the mold, and you pour into the gap. The skin comes out open at the bottom, where the core is pulled out. Uses an Open Bottom with the key plate"
msgstr "在直接打印的模具中浇铸一层薄而有弹性的表皮（乳胶、硅胶——如面罩、袖套）：一个打印的芯模——即向内缩小了表皮厚度的模型——立在模具内的键板上，然后向间隙中灌注。表皮在底部开口，芯模从此处抽出。使用带键板的 Open Bottom"

#: properties.py:881
msgid "Cast g/ml"
msgstr "浇铸密度 g/ml"

#: properties.py:889
msgid "Cast in the pour box itself: after the silicone cures, turn the whole mold over onto the pour funnel's mouth, which carries the weight, and pour the cast into the silicone's open base. Short thin legs from the top of the shell end in feet level with the mouth and keep it from tipping (Pour Box with an Open Bottom or Locking Base)"
msgstr "直接在灌注盒中浇铸：硅胶固化后，将整个模具翻转扣在灌注漏斗的口上（由漏斗口承重），然后从硅胶的开放底部灌注浇铸件。从外壳顶部伸出的短细支脚末端为与漏斗口齐平的支脚，防止倾倒（Pour Box 配合 Open Bottom 或 Locking Base）"

#: properties.py:871
msgid "Casting / candle wax ≈ 0.90"
msgstr "浇铸蜡 / 蜡烛蜡 ≈ 0.90"

#: properties.py:866
