#: properties.py:899
msgid "Cut the legs' feet at this angle (degrees), so the turned-over mold stands tilted and air rises out of one side of the cast as you pour. It leans to the side that needs the least leg, and the feet on the low side move out to keep it from tipping. 0 = level"
msgstr "以此角度（度）切割支脚底部，使翻转后的模具倾斜站立，浇注时空气从铸件一侧排出。它会向所需支脚最短的一侧倾斜，低侧的脚向外移动以防倾倒。0 = 水平"

#: properties.py:685
msgid "Cut the mold along your own split planes (Add Split Plane: move and rotate each one anywhere, add as many as you like) instead of the standard split. With Clamp Wings on, every plane gets a bolted flange; a direct mold gets alignment keys on every cut"
msgstr "沿自定义分型面切割模具（添加分型面：可任意移动和旋转每个分型面，数量不限），而非标准分型。启用夹紧翼时，每个分型面都会生成带螺栓的法兰；直接打印模具则会在每个切割处生成对齐键"

