#: properties.py:657
msgid "Printer Fit also cuts a too-tall positive into glue-up sections that self-align: pegs printed on each face seat into sockets in the next (nothing is ever added to its cast surface). Untick to always keep the positive whole - print it tilted or split it yourself"
msgstr "打印机适配还会把过高的阳模切成可自对准的粘接段：每个面上打印的销钉嵌入相邻段的孔中（绝不在其浇注表面添加任何东西）。取消勾选则始终保持阳模完整——倾斜打印或自行拆分"

