msgid "Printer Fit: your printer's maximum print height in mm (0 = off). Any shell taller than this is cut into stacked levels - each with a bolted seam ring all around - and a too-tall positive into glue-up sections that self-align with printed pegs (nothing on its cast surface), so every piece fits the build plate"
msgstr "打印机适配：打印机的最大打印高度（毫米，0 = 关闭）。任何高于此高度的外壳都会被切成堆叠层——每层四周带螺栓连接的接缝环——过高的阳模则切成用打印销钉自对准的粘接段（浇注表面上没有任何东西），让每个部件都能放入打印平台"

